00:35:43.950 --> 00:36:06.780
<v Sean Cole>I watch the video several more times on my own. And I realize that maybe there's this one other thing that's unsettling for Zack when he sees the scene in the hotel room. Zack told me he doesn't want to be on TV anymore like he used to. But it's clear his delusion still does. The Zack in the hotel room still has this naked, unfettered ambition of wanting to perform, wanting all the cameras on him.
<v Sean Cole>我独自一人又看了几次那个视频。我意识到扎克在看酒店房间那段时，可能还有另一件不安的事。扎克告诉我他不再像过去那样想上电视了。但很明显，他的妄想仍然想。酒店房间里的扎克仍然有一种裸露的、不受束缚的想要表演的野心，想要所有的摄像机都对着他。

