00:59:51.310 --> 01:00:09.040
<v Sean Cole>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to my boss, Ira Glass. So this is weird. I called him to ask him about the show this week. And he was at the beach with his pet donkey. And I'm like, what are you doing? And he's like--
<v Sean Cole>《美国生活》由PRX（公共广播交易所）传送到公共广播电台。一如既往感谢我的老板，艾拉·格拉斯。这太奇怪了。我打电话问他这周的节目。他当时在海滩上，带着他的宠物驴。我问，你在做什么？他说——

01:00:09.040 --> 01:00:11.080
<v Zack McDermott>Coconut oil on that ass now.
<v Zack McDermott>现在给屁股涂点椰子油。

01:00:11.080 --> 01:00:16.080
<v Sean Cole>I'm Sean Cole. Ira will be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Sean Cole>我是肖恩·科尔。艾拉下周将带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
